GlyphCull Compiler — Third-Party Notices
=========================================

Bundled fonts (assets/fonts/)
----------------------------

The compiler bundles the Noto Sans font family (Regular, Bold, Italic,
BoldItalic) from the Noto Project (https://github.com/notofonts/latin-greek-cyrillic),
version 2.015, for default glyph atlas generation.

- Copyright 2022 The Noto Project Authors
  (https://github.com/notofonts/latin-greek-cyrillic)
- Licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1
  (see assets/fonts/OFL.txt).

The fonts are embedded (in the form of generated MSDF atlases) into compiled
`.cull` packages at build time, which the OFL permits without restriction.

Fetch reproducibility: scripts/fetch-fonts.sh downloads the exact release
archive; the committed checksums (scripts/font-checksums.sha256) verify the
downloaded files byte-for-byte.

Rust crates
-----------

This repository's crates depend on the following crates from crates.io
(licenses as declared by their authors):

- flate2 (MIT OR Apache-2.0) — zlib compression
- sha2 (MIT OR Apache-2.0) — SHA-256 for SEAL and digests
- proptest (MIT OR Apache-2.0) — dev: property tests
- unicode-normalization (MIT OR Apache-2.0) — NFC normalization
- pulldown-cmark (MIT) — Markdown parsing
- html5ever (MIT OR Apache-2.0) — HTML5 parsing
- tendril (MIT OR Apache-2.0) — HTML token streams
- ttf-parser (MIT OR Apache-2.0) — font parsing
- png (MIT OR Apache-2.0) — PNG decode at compile time
- jpeg-decoder (MIT OR Apache-2.0) — JPEG decode at compile time
